# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: IRICE-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look material
wait 3
note panel: x 1844..1904, y 380..700 (mute 1874,410; slider 1874 440..640; button 1874,670); card x 1536..1832 bottom 700
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ptr glide 1874 410 200 sleep 300 glide 1874 540 200 sleep 300 glide 1874 670 200 sleep 300 click
wait 0.5
ptr glide 1700 600 300
wait 3
shot held-while-on-card
note it stays up while the pointer moves over toggle, slider and card
ptr glide 1000 600 300
wait 2
shot gone
note gone ~1.6 s after leaving
ipc shortcut volumeUp
ptr glide 1874 640 150 sleep 50 down sleep 20 glide 1874 440 200 sleep 20 up
wait 0.5
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note 1.00, handle at the top
ptr move 1874 425 sleep 50 click
wait 0.3
shot empty-click
note nothing happens between toggle and slider
ptr move 1300 540 sleep 50 click
wait 0.3
note the click reaches the desktop (outside panel/card)
